%% Sprint Flight-1 — Sequence: Back-fill manual de Series Retroativo
%% Spec: Docs/specs/sprint-flight-1.md (RF-13)
%% ADRs: 090 (single source of truth)
%%
%% Fluxo: Founder tem ~30 torneios Phased historicos pagos (lista mental).
%% Acessa /flight → "Adicionar Series Retroativo" → form cria serie nova +
%% multi-select de tournaments existentes da biblioteca → N requests PATCH
%% para linkar (sem endpoint batch dedicado — D8 simplificou). Apos linkar,
%% reports historicos consolidam P&L combined.

sequenceDiagram
    actor F as Founder
    participant FP as /flight page<br/>(RF-10)
    participant BD as BackfillDialog<br/>(RF-13)
    participant SAPI as POST /api/tournament-series<br/>(RF-03)
    participant LAPI as PATCH /api/tournaments/:id<br/>(existente)
    participant ST as storage.ts
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Q as TanStack Query

    F->>FP: Acessa /flight (sidebar Ferramentas)
    F->>FP: Click "Adicionar Series Retroativo"
    FP->>BD: open(BackfillDialog)

    Note over BD: Etapa 1 — Criar Serie

    BD->>F: Form: name, network (dropdown sites),<br/>totalDay1s, day2DateTime (datetime picker),<br/>stackMode radio (single/combined),<br/>notes opcional
    F->>BD: Preenche e clica "Criar serie"

    BD->>SAPI: POST /api/tournament-series<br/>{name: 'Sunday Million Phased',<br/>network: 'PokerStars', totalDay1s: 17,<br/>day2DateTime: '2025-12-15T19:00:00Z',<br/>stackMode: 'combined'}

    SAPI->>SAPI: requireAuth + Zod validate<br/>(insertTournamentSeriesSchema)
    SAPI->>ST: createSeries(userId, payload)
    ST->>DB: INSERT INTO tournament_series<br/>(id=nanoid, day2_status='pending')
    DB-->>ST: serie criada
    ST-->>SAPI: TournamentSeries
    SAPI-->>BD: 201 {id: 'newSeriesId', ...}

    BD->>Q: invalidateQueries(['tournament-series'])
    BD->>BD: Avanca para Etapa 2

    Note over BD: Etapa 2 — Multi-select Tournaments

    BD->>Q: useQuery(['tournaments',<br/>{filter: 'no_series'}])<br/>(filtros opcionais: site, periodo)
    Q-->>BD: lista de tournaments com series_id=NULL

    F->>BD: Filtra por site=PokerStars,<br/>periodo=ultimos 6 meses
    F->>BD: Visualiza lista (ex: 47 candidates)
    F->>BD: Multi-select 5 entries<br/>(usa search por nome/data)
    F->>BD: Click "Linkar a serie"

    BD->>BD: Mostra confirm: "5 tournaments<br/>serao linkados a 'Sunday Million Phased'.<br/>Continuar?"
    F->>BD: Confirma

    Note over BD: Sem endpoint batch (D8 simplificou).<br/>Loop sequencial de PATCH com progress bar.

    loop para cada tournamentId selecionado
        BD->>LAPI: PATCH /api/tournaments/:tournamentId<br/>{seriesId: 'newSeriesId'}

        LAPI->>LAPI: requireAuth + Zod validate
        LAPI->>ST: linkTournamentToSeries(userId, tId, seriesId)<br/>(owner check em ambos)

        alt tournament nao pertence ao user OU<br/>series nao pertence ao user
            ST-->>LAPI: error
            LAPI-->>BD: 404 {message: 'Not found'}
            BD->>BD: Marca entry como FALHOU,<br/>continua loop
        end

        ST->>DB: UPDATE tournaments<br/>SET series_id = ?<br/>WHERE id = ? AND user_id = ?
        DB-->>ST: row atualizada
        ST-->>LAPI: tournament atualizado
        LAPI-->>BD: 200 {tournament}

        BD->>BD: Atualiza progress bar<br/>(N/M linkados)
    end

    BD->>Q: invalidateQueries:<br/>['tournaments'],<br/>['tournament-series'],<br/>['tournament-series', seriesId]

    alt todos sucesso
        BD->>F: Toast "5 tournaments linkados<br/>a 'Sunday Million Phased'"
    else parciais
        BD->>F: Toast "4/5 linkados<br/>(1 falhou — ver detalhes)"
    end

    BD->>FP: Fecha dialog<br/>+ navega para /flight/:newSeriesId

    FP->>Q: useQuery(['tournament-series', newSeriesId])
    Q-->>FP: {series, entries: 5, planneds: []}
    FP->>F: Renderiza detail panel<br/>(P&L combined, badges Phased nas entries)

    Note over F,DB: Reports/dashboard agora agregam essas 5 entries via series_id<br/>(RF-15). Founder repete fluxo para outras ~25 series historicas.<br/>Empty state da biblioteca apos back-fill: "0 / 17 Day 1s pagos" pra<br/>series sem entries linkadas (caso founder crie serie sem entries).
